  "label": "child represents the playful, innocent interpretation of mental disorders",
  "description": "The visual of the child playfully touching the adult's face is mapped onto the text 'when each letter is a mental disorder' to imply that the child's innocent, lighthearted behavior symbolizes the absurd or trivialized notion of mental disorders being reduced to individual letters. The child's playfulness is used as an analogy for the meme's joke, which mocks mental illness by framing it as a childish game.",
